    "detailed_description": "There Is No Stairs<br>Another pain here...No, there is a platformer game. Follow the bird who stole the blueprint!<br>Although there are no stairs in the world, a reliable rocket launcher is with you instead.<br><br>\u25c7 Aim Under Your Feet and Shoot<br><br>\u25c7 Jump higher and farther with the recoil of a rocket explosion!<br><br>\u25c7 Go After That [s]Freaking[/s] Pigeon Bird!<br><br>\u25c7 The timing of exquisite aiming and jumping is the key to success.<br><br>\u25c7 Progress Is Not Saved.<br><br>\u25c7 Feel how much you're improving every time you fall!<br><br>\u25c7 If you can get the blueprint back, this year's Bonel Award will be yours!<br><br><br>&quot;Isn't it faster to draw a blueprint again?&quot; - Assistant A.",
